          "text": "Ethiopic script font designed in a handwritten style.\n\nThe Geʾez Handwriting with Arrows regular typeface applies directional arrows to the basic style to indicate stroke direction. \n\nThis font is part of a collection of 14 typefaces developed to help teach handwriting to children.\n\nProject Homepage: https://github.com/raeytype/geez-handwriting-fonts"
